    wangshuang "But it's the exact opposite - the sun stays alive simply because it has not done what it's meant to do. Its mission is incomplete. And its death or livelihood has nothing to do with the thoughts of anything else, even itself."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:111
translate english route1_start_084107bb:

